  nameText: {fileID: 1507290361}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 448377634}
  npcDialogues:
  - Hi! What can i get you, a beer?
  - Don't blame me for trying to make a living!
  - Oh yes Bob! A bit wierd but i liked him
  - He was working on some sorta ship, i think... He always talked about "the people
    before" and where they went
  - If you ask nicely, you can maybe borrow Leelas boat?
  playerDialogues:
  - its 10 in the morning...
  - Fair enough... Do you remember Bob
  - Do you know what happened to him?
  - How can you get to th lighthouse?
  - Good idea, thanks! See ya!
  npcName: Stan
